WEBVTT

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:03.630
I’m off to school!

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:04.940
Take care!

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.150
Of course. I’m always prepared for anything!

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:11.050
Oh hoho! That Ichigo!

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:13.460
She’s never better ain’t she?
That’s great.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:15.620
Hey honey, look at this!

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.410
Tada!

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:22.000
This is an album from way before...
Where did you find this?

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:25.880
In a cabinet from the kitchen. I think it
was misplaced there when we moved.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.340
This sure brings back memories...

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:32.800
Ever since she was a kid, she made
us worry a lot while growing up.

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:38.570
Yeah, compared to other kids,
she was a handful.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:41.000
She was so small and so energetic.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.000
I’d hate to see her grow up.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.250
Yes, she’s already grown since she got a boyfriend.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.380
Wait a minute,
what did you say just now?

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:51.760
What? As I said, boyfriend...

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:55.000
Come on, Ichigo’s
in Junior High already...

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.160
She’s ONLY in Junior High school!

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:02.580
This is unbelievable and...
I won’t allow it!

00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:15.070
Face!

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:19.800
On the face! Good, rounds done.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:22.560
Practice ends here. Dismissed!

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:24.060
Thank you very much.

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:26.670
Otsukaresama-deshita!

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:30.380
Watching him from here is the best way.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:33.070
Aoyoma-kun is so cool!

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:36.150
He looked this way! {Wahaa!}

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:48.830
Shall we go, Ichigo?

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:51.900
Okay.

00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:00.200
You surprised me, Aoyama-kun!

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:01.860
It’s because our eyes met.

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:03.330
They didn’t!

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:09.690
I feel refreshed. It felt weird when we were hiding it.

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:12.220
Now we can be together everyday.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:22.260
Happiness, bliss, joy!

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:25.620
I’ve never been happier my whole life!

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:27.520
Bye!

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:28.940
See you tomorrow!

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:35.800
I l-o-v-e y-o-u!

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:42.490
Ichigo, is the table set?

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:43.590
Yes!

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:48.180
Ichigo. you look so happy.
Did something good happen?

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:50.250
Hehehehe, well...

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:54.970
What happened, Ichigo? If something good
happened, then you must tell us.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:57.440
Well today, Aoyama-kun...

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.630
What happened with Aoyama-kun?

00:02:59.630 --> 00:03:01.300
Actually...

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.550
It’s that guy.

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:03.160
Huh?

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:07.120
That’s the boyfriend I just found out about!

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:10.730
Uh... See, you really fooled your dad!

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:14.500
You shouldn’t tell these kinds of jokes
to your father. Right, Ichigo?

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:18.270
Well Ichigo is still in Junior High.

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:19.280
Right? Ichigo?

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:20.550
Err, yeah...

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:24.200
See!! That’s what I thought.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.500
Gee, so that’s it?

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:33.460
Hey mom, what was that
a while ago...?

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:40.050
Ichigo, it’s better to not tell your dad
if you’re going out with someone or not.

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:41.110
Why?

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:46.580
Your dad is the jealous type, he’s not
ready to hear that kind of thing.

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:03.240
Good morning, Aoyama...

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:09.350
Good morning, Masaya... I wish! Ahahaa

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:12.620
I’m off!

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:14.040
Watch out for cars okay?

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:15.210
Haii!

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:19.920
What are you doing, dad?

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:22.460
Hey Ichigo, today’s a nice day isn’t it?

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:24.070
Y-Yes it is...

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:27.640
Sorry about yesterday, getting mad over nothing.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:29.740
Here, I bought this for you and your boyfriend.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:32.200
Ehh really! Thanks dad!

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:36.140
Woah, look at the time!
Isn’t Aoyama-kun waiting for you?

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:37.980
Really? Oh yeah, I have to hurry.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.270
Bye dad!

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:40.170
Just a moment, Ichigo.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:42.090
Huh?

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.910
Just as I expected, you have been fooling me!

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:50.310
Um huh!? Yeah.

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:53.020
We’re going to talk about this, get back inside!

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:55.230
No I can’t, I have a date!

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:57.230
I said that I won’t allow this didn’t I!?

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:00.540
I hate the fact you’re keeping a secret from your parents.

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:04.350
Don’t pretend it didn’t happen.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.910
Don’t run away, Ichigo!

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:11.870
Geez, why is this happening?!

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:14.970
Damnit you!!!

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:16.540
Don’t take me lightly!

00:05:18.140 --> 00:05:20.540
Iiicchhiii...go!!

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:24.510
Ichigo-san? Didn’t you have a day off today?

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:27.240
Didn’t you have a date
with Aoyama-san?

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:28.970
Is this a marathon date?

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:31.920
What kind of date is that?

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:36.890
I see, so it was your father?

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.500
What do you want us to do?

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:41.830
Anyway, please do something!

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:45.550
I understand your problem,
but this is...

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:49.540
But nothing will be resolved if outsiders get involved with a fight between parent and child.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.720
Even a dog won’t touch a fight
between a parent and child.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.350
That refers to a fight between siblings.

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:54.830
It’s the same!

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.230
It will take time to sort this out,

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:01.590
...and it’s a fight between a couple
that a dog won’t touch.

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:04.580
This is not the time to talk about that!

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:07.260
You just need to talk this out...

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:08.200
But...

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:11.300
If words are not enough, then you have
to go for a life or death fight!

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.910
To make yourself heard,
you have to use martial arts!

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:16.790
My dad and I used to do that before.

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:18.080
When was that?

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:20.920
Anyway maybe it’s better for you to go home now.

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:23.050
I hope everything works out well.

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:26.900
That’s so cold...

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:31.820
I won’t worry about that!
Now I have a date to think about.

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:39.290
Where did she go?

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:42.250
Ichigo, come out here!

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:46.860
Ichigo, didn’t you want to go to Shibuya?

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:50.370
No it’s okay, this is better.

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:02.300
Wanna sit down?

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.140
You’re acting weird today.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:17.900
Eh? No it’s nothing. {Ya ahahaa~}

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:20.930
Ichigo.

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:21.710
Yes!!

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:25.530
If you don’t want to talk about it,
I’ll understand,

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:28.920
...but I don’t want to just watch when you have a problem.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:31.130
Aoyama-kun...

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.700
Talk to me.

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:38.580
I see... It’s your father...

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:43.040
My dad is just being stubborn.

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:46.330
He didn’t even hear me out when I tried to explain.

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:47.960
Then, I’ll talk to him.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:50.960
You can’t do that!
You don’t know what’ll happen.

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:53.670
I didn’t know he would be
that obstinate.

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:54.430
But...

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:55.740
Don’t worry.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:58.450
I feel better after talking about it.

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:03.920
I don’t want it to bother you.
Don’t worry about it.

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:08.670
So this is that Aoyama?
The look of him makes my blood boil.

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:12.440
Just going into someone’s room without
permission would get you scolded.

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:16.700
This weakling... Ichigo... Ichigo!

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:21.200
What do you mean by weakling?
Aoyama-kun is strong in kendo.

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:23.270
If I say “weakling” then he’s a weakling!

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:24.840
Hey darling...

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:29.220
...won’t you have more faith
in those two?

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:33.820
Don’t you remember? We also got together
when we were in Junior High.

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:36.300
But that’s a different story.

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:37.740
Oh, how is it so different?

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.770
It’s different because
I say it’s different!

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:13.780
Ichigo, you...

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:14.360
What?

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:16.320
How far have you gone with Aoyama?

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:20.680
What are you saying? And while we’re
eating dinner? Are you stupid?

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:25.750
So... it’s something that can’t be talked about at dinner!?

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:32.670
Why are you being so quiet?

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:36.110
You’ve got to be kidding me!!
Of course I wouldn’t do that!

00:09:36.110 --> 00:09:39.640
Besides, you don’t report to your
parents about every little thing!

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:46.440
AaaoOO...YAaa...MA!!!

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:50.900
Yes, Momomiya residence.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.340
Ah! It’s been a while.

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:56.400
AaaoooyaaamMMAAA~!!

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:54.720
Ichigo, call for you!

00:09:56.510 --> 00:09:57.310
Okay.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:02.870
I just came from cram school.
I was worried.

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:06.540
I wanted to meet you, but... maybe
it wouldn’t be such a good idea.

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:08.960
I’m sorry. I’ll call you
on the cellphone...

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:11.570
HELLO!! This is Ichigo’s father!

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:14.460
<i>Nice to meet you. I’m Aoyama Masaya.</i>

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:18.510
Give it back, dad!
Give it back!

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:18.510
Oh oh! Having the nerve
to call this house!

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:20.360
<i>Where are you right now?</i>

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:21.720
Inuhara Park.

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:23.310
Okay, wait there!

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:27.790
Wait!

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:30.350
A bike is unfair!!!

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:31.780
In such a situation...

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:36.510
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:10:57.860 --> 00:10:59.300
Where did he go?

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:04.200
You should know why I came here.

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:07.220
Yes. It’s about Ichigo and I.

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:09.250
You’re being presumptuous...

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:11.660
I forbid you and Ichigo to.....

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:11.660
I decline.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:12.710
WHAT!?

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:16.150
Now that you know,
please let us go out.

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:21.920
We are serious about each other...
and our feelings.....

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:22.970
Shut up!

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:26.390
It has nothing to do with being serious or not!

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:29.150
You’re just kids...

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:33.560
Before you can fall in love, you have
to stand on your own feet.

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:38.240
And you still have lots of things you need to do.

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:40.550
That’s all I wanted to say.

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:46.020
Crap. When I was transforming into Mew Strawberry,

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:48.470
I lost track of where he was going!

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:52.330
Yes, we are kids.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:54.710
And we still have a lot of things we need to do...

00:11:55.460 --> 00:12:00.940
But... when you have someone you love,
I don’t think it will become a hindrance.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:03.950
It will even lend us strength.

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:07.470
I am not distorting any
of these feelings,

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:10.610
...and I think Ichigo feels the same way.

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:17.400
You do kendo right?

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:18.940
Yes...

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:20.490
This Sunday...

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:23.840
I challenge you to a duel!

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:28.310
If you win then you can do whatever you like.

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:32.680
What! My dad said that!!?

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:34.650
Yes, he was really cool.

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:37.360
I’m sorry...

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:39.630
Why are you apologizing?

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:41.220
It’s okay.

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:46.590
Besides, in some way I understand
why your dad is doing this.

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:47.580
Eh?

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:52.730
He made it clear, he thinks the world of you.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:55.640
Aoyama-kun...

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:56.290
Yes?

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:59.480
So are you really going to duel with my father?

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:00.310
Sure I will.

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:01.320
Why?

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:05.030
Because if we run away now, we wouldn’t
be recognized as a couple.

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:08.260
Well... I guess, I don’t know.

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:12.220
Don’t worry. With justice on our side,
it will all work out.

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:15.440
It could be...

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:35.440
<i>And so, on the morning of the duel...</i>

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:46.490
I’m on my way.

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:54.330
Aaah! What should I do?
They’re really going to duel!

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:56.020
I really am worried!

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:57.630
Ichigo!

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:00.940
Mom?

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:05.110
Mom... erm...

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:08.570
Ichigo, what do you like about Aoyama-kun?

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:09.560
Eh?

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:13.040
We’ll have one match.
Whoever gets the point wins.

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:14.240
Understand?

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:15.260
Yes!

00:14:15.260 --> 00:14:17.160
His smile, I think...

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:21.650
Aoyama-kun is so much more mature
than me and knows a lot of things...

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:25.730
but he’s really nice, and when he
smiles he looks much kinder...

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:29.860
but sometimes his smile looks so sad...

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:35.170
So if I can do something, I want to be able
to make him always smile so kindly.

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:40.710
You really like him.

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:42.110
Yes.

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:53.890
You won’t hear this from your dad,

00:14:55.850 --> 00:14:59.250
but your dad and I started going out
when we were in Junior High.

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:08.570
Yep... and at that time my father...
that’s your grandfather...

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:11.080
...he got mad, it was bad.

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:14.910
This is the first time I heard that.

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:18.450
At that time it came down
to a duel too.

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:21.370
And then, what happened?

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:22.100
Well...

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:25.070
Face!

00:15:29.710 --> 00:15:30.640
Umm...

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:33.970
Are you ok?

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:35.140
Shallow...

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:39.810
That was only shallow.

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:44.000
We can’t call that a point right?

00:15:44.900 --> 00:15:46.500
Let’s go.

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:52.330
He fell down again and again but he stood right after...

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:57.850
...in the end my father gave up and
allowed us to be together.

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:02.750
Hey Ichigo, look at this...

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:12.820
We haven’t told you this... but when
you were born, you were so small...

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:16.270
...that the doctor couldn’t reassure us.

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:20.030
And so everyday your dad

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:22.600
...would go speak to you through the glass of the observation room...

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:25.740
...and tell you to do hang in there.

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:29.780
Because of that your dad become known in the hospital.

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:39.890
Of course you don’t remember. But to your
father and I, it was like only yesterday...

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:49.320
From then on, your father was always looking out for you.

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:54.780
Your father loves you the most in the world.

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:03.150
I understand that,

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:06.210
I know that...

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:07.710
Yes...

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:09.270
I’m going after them.

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:10.420
Go for it, Ichigo!

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:18.870
Shall we stop here?

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:21.620
Giving up already?

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:27.250
Sure, but if we stop here then you lose.

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:29.360
You haven’t scored one point yet.

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:30.820
Father...

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:34.220
You have no right to call me father!

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:06.140
STOP!

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:09.590
That’s enough!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.610
Please, I beg you... forgive us.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:17.070
Don’t interfere. This is a fight between men!

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.770
Ichigo, it’s ok.

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:22.030
Until I defeat your father, I can’t stop either.

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:23.770
You have guts.

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:26.450
Let’s see how long you can
hold that up.

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:37.510
What do you mean by “fight between men”?
We’re not doing anything wrong.

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:39.840
If there’s something about my friends, at least tell me!

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:42.210
Come, I’ll take you on!

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:48.120
<i>Shintaro! Shintaro!</i>

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:49.390
<i>Get a hold of yourself!</i>

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:54.000
<i>Father, Shintaro and I will always be together.</i>

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:57.390
<i>If you don’t approve then fight me!</i>

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:00.410
Come, fight me!

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:24.430
You really are my
and Sakura’s daughter.

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:28.480
Hey you, Aoyama!

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:35.680
You better treat Ichigo right.

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:37.680
Yes!

00:19:41.630 --> 00:19:45.980
Ouch, my body hurts...

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:57.590
She looks so happy.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:00.400
Something good must have happened.

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:02.700
She’s so easy to read, isn’t she?

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:04.690
Yes she is.

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:18.070
There there... don’t cry!

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:19.420
Ichigo, Ichigo is...

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:23.060
That can’t be helped, then shall we make a new one?

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:25.910
I envy you, Minto,

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:28.790
every time it’s “Little Miss Little Miss” and always being pampered by everyone.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:33.000
Ah, but I also long for the common life like yours.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.330
C-Common?!

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:37.910
A small house where you can go around in one and a half minutes

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:39.920
and just having simple food...

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.720
I really envy you...

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:43.300
Evil Minto!

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:47.140
Next: “Princess fight! The hero can’t be bought for money”

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:50.770
Ahh, I’m not evil!
It’s what I really feel!

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:52.900
Now you’re even worse!
